msgstr "謝謝!如果我們回覆時您不在,我們會寄電子郵件到 {known}。"

#: src/panel/chat.ts
msgid "The file is too large."
msgstr "檔案過大。"

#: src/panel/chat.ts
msgid "This file type is not accepted."
msgstr "不支援此檔案類型。"

#: src/panel/chat.ts
